    <string name="setup_brain">Brain</string>
    <string name="setup_brain_body">Reminders, deadlines, phone actions and questions about your day work without a model. For open conversation and deeper analysis, Holstrom runs a language model entirely on this phone. Nothing is ever sent anywhere.</string>
