    <string name="setup_model_help">Recommended: Gemma 3n E2B (about 2 billion effective parameters, gemma-3n-E2B-it-int4.task, ~3 GB) or Gemma 2 2B IT. Download a MediaPipe .task file from Hugging Face (litert-community) or Kaggle on any device, copy it to this phone and import it here. You can delete the downloaded copy afterwards. Phones with 6 GB of RAM or more work best.</string>
